# cpu_usage/mem_usage etc with CPU/Mem but no Pods - both are keyed by the
# now-differing "workload" field, so merge couldn't combine them), and (b)
# makes namespaceNetworkQueries.ts's "by workload" queries hard-fail with
# Prometheus's "many-to-many matching not allowed" the moment their `* on
# (cluster,namespace,pod) group_left(workload,workload_type)` join sees two
# differently-labeled rows for the same pod on the right-hand side.
